itle":"'Beyond The Haze' LP Released Today!","sourceUrl":"","body":"<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1627673364000\" id=\"item-61044792e3419144471d3d3b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-5626bc858bbdc1865ce1\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Today is an exciting day that has been a long time coming, and I\u2019m trying to find the words to describe it.  Do you ever experience a certain smell or sound that suddenly transports you back in time?  It\u2019s not that it links you to a specific memory, more just a feeling from the past of how you used to be.  You\u2019ve been changing so gradually over time in mind and body that it\u2019s jarring in a way, you realize you used to experience the world in a totally different way than you do now.  In some ways, this album is like that for me.  These songs span across a number of chapters in my life.  In some I feel the brashness of youth, what it sounds like to be searching, and in others, balance.  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If I\u2019m lucky, one of these songs will stick to you in that way.  It might not be for ten years that it comes to fruition, but you\u2019ll hear one of these for the first time in a long time, and be flooded with the summer of 2021 \u2014 what it feels like to be you right now.  And I hope more than anything, you feel like you\u2019re living your best life, or making the right moves to get there.  And you\u2019ll hear one of these songs, and you won\u2019t know why, but for a second you\u2019ll be transported into that way of being \u2014 not because the song is transformational, but merely a mile marker in your journey.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Much love,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Andrew</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>","excerpt":"","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":1,"unsaved":false,"author":{"id":"55e0f0f5e4b0eea3c349e57e","displayName":"Chad alburn","firstName":"Chad","lastName":"alburn","bio":""},"fullUrl":"/news/2021/7/30/beyond-the-haze-lp-released-today","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55e8e2d5e4b071dc30cae0c0/1627673339417-RB6WQDBOLLDXIRM9EK4G/Album+Cover+Final.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"originalSize":"2500x2500","recordTypeLabel":"text","title":"'Beyond The Haze' LP Released Today!","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""}},"collection":{"id":"59ff8eabe31d1945638d3168","websiteId":"55e8e2d5e4b071dc30cae0c0","video":{"playbackSpeed":1,"zoom":0},"backgroundSource":1,"enabled":true,"starred":false,"type":1,"ordering":2,"title":"News","navigationTitle":"News","urlId":"news","itemCount":13,"updatedOn":1627674560610,"description":"","pageSize":18,"features":{"relatedItems":{"isEnabled":false},"productQuickView":{"isEnabled":false},"systemBlogCollection":{"postDisplay":"excerpt"}},"eventView":1,"folder":false,"dropdown":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"homepage":false,"typeName":"blog","regionName":"default","synchronizing":false,"categoryPagesSeoHidden":false,"tagPagesSeoHidden":false,"qrCodeEnabled":false,"pagePermissionType":1,"typeLabel":"blog","fullUrl":"/news","passwordProtected":false,"draft